In the case that $r_2=0$, by \eqref{Eq901-10} and \eqref{Eq901-17}, we have
\begin{align*}
&\quad[X^\pm_{i,r_1},[X^\pm_{i,r_2},X^\pm_{j,s}]]=-[X^\pm_{i,r_1},[X^\pm_{i,r_2+1},X^\pm_{j,s-1}]]\\
&=-[X^\pm_{i,r_2+1},[X^\pm_{i,r_1},X^\pm_{j,s-1}]]=0.
