Similarly, we obtain
\begin{align*}
[H_{n-1,2},X^+_{n+1,2r+1}]&=-[H_{n-1,2},[X^+_{n,2r+1},X^-_{n-1,0}]]\\
&=2[X^+_{n,2r+1},X^-_{n-1,2}]=2[X^+_{n,2r+3},X^-_{n-1,0}]=-2X^+_{n+1,2r+3},
\end{align*}
where the third equality is due to Corollary~\ref{Cor} 2.
