As in the construction of the median core, we set 
  \[
    Y_0^\phi:=\{m_{\bar X}(\tilde{x},\tilde{y},\tilde{z}) \ |\ \tilde{x},\tilde{y},\tilde{z}\in \phi(B)\subseteq \partial_r X, \ x_i\neq x_j\}\subseteq X
