Based on the spatial symmetries of the water molecule, the four peaks of the DOS are attributed to the $\mathrm{2a_1}$, $\mathrm{1b_2}$, $\mathrm{3a_1}$, and $\mathrm{1b_1}$ orbitals, consistent with the case in the water monomer systems.
