\title{Convergence rates for regularized unbalanced optimal transport: the discrete case}
\author{Luca Nenna\thanks{Universit\'e Paris-Saclay, CNRS, Laboratoire de math\'ematiques d'Orsay, ParMA, Inria Saclay, 91405, Orsay, France. 
