where $H_{cf}$ is a $1 \times (2N_g-1)$ vector with the only non-zero component $A k_+$ appearing at the position $(1, N_g)$, and
\begin{eqnarray}
    && \tilde{H}_f(\kk)=\begin{pmatrix}
