\subsection{Tl$_2$Se$_2$/Zn$_2$Te$_2$ heterostructure with moir\'e potential}
% \commentCXL{
% 1. Why moir\'e potential in Tl$_2$Se$_2$ layer is different from that in Zn$_2$Te$_2$ layer? Show figures to discuss that. How Rashba SOC enhance band dispersion of flat band in one case? How Rashba SOC is quenched by confining potential in other case? 
