\caption{Numerical results for the chiral-odd GPD $H^{u+d}_{T}$ at fixed $t = -0.5~\mathrm{GeV}^{2}$ with varying $\xi$ (upper panel), and at fixed $\xi = 0.25$ with varying $t$ (lower panel).}
