\title{
Making Leveraged Exchange-Traded Funds Work for your Portfolio 
}
\author{Peter A. Forsyth\thanks{Cheriton School of Computer Science, University of Waterloo, Waterloo
ON, Canada, N2L 3G1, \texttt{paforsyt@uwaterloo.ca}} \and Pieter M. van Staden\thanks{National Australia Bank, Melbourne, Victoria, Australia 3000. The
