\subsubsection{\textbf{Comparison of Semantic Richness between ID-free Embedding and ID Embedding}}
To verify the semantic richness of ID-free embeddings in IDFREE, we perform Gaussian kernel density estimation visualization comparison between all item ID embeddings in ID-based MCFRec methods and all item textual and visual embeddings output by Eq.~(\ref{eq:positional_encoding_embedding}). 
