Assume that the conditions of lemma \ref{B2} hold. Then $\underline{\overline{\Tr}\overset{\sim}{M}} \cong \underline{\overline{\Tr}\overset{\sim}{N}}$ if and only if $\underline{\overset{\sim}{M}} \cong \underline{\overset{\sim}{N}}$. In particular, any choice of free resolutions for $\overset{\sim}{M}$ has no effect and $\overline{\Tr}\overset{\sim}{M}$ is uniquely defined under stabilization.
\end{cor}
