\begin{equation}
0 \rightarrow \mathcal{H}om_{\mathcal{O}_X}(\overset{\sim} M,\mathcal{O}_X) \rightarrow \mathcal{H}om_{\mathcal{O}_X}(\overset{\sim} {F_1},\mathcal{O}_X) \rightarrow \overset{\sim}{\lambda M} \rightarrow 0 
\end{equation}
Now, the result follows using \ref{B24} and \ref{B1}.
\item [(2)] Follows using similar argument as used above, previous isomorphism and Five Lemma.
