\caption{\small Transverse diffusion coefficient as a function of magnetic field using the hanging string approach. Red, green, blue, brown, orange, and magenta plots correspond to  $T/T_c=1.0$, 1.1, 1.2, 1.3, 1.4, and  1.5, respectively. In units of $\text{GeV}$.}
